tains and  he is now only a few steps away from  achieving his ultimate dream of becoming  the wizard king however as is tradition  at this point it turns out that asta is  once again lagging behind his rival yuno  during the time skip yuno was already  named a grand magic knight which is one  step above asta in the rankings and in  fact real comments that yuno just broke  his record as the youngest mage to ever  become a grand magic knight fugoleon  then makes it clear that asta deserves  the same title as you know but it seems  that the stigma surrounding asta's devil  and the whole trial process is what has  been dragging asta down during these  past 15 months basically he would have  been promoted together with yuno but he  couldn't because he had to beat the  charges first at the banquet following  the ceremony a few people inquire about  the whereabouts of the wizard king  himself who clearly should have been  present at the ceremony but these  questions are brushed off because julius  does have a tendency to transform and  just sneak around incognito we then  learned that fugolian nosel and  merauleona are all candidates for  becoming the next wizard king but it  looks like they all declined the offer  marijuana doesn't want the title she  doesn't want to deal with that type of  stuff and nozell and fugolian seem to  believe that they must become much  stronger before taking on such an  important position even though the spate  and heart kingdoms have mostly recovered  from the recent conflict and the  continent appears to be at peace there  is still demonic activity out there on  the fringes of the clover kingdom so  they're not out of the woods yet in fact  juno and the golden dawn along with the  black bulls who are not present at the  ceremony have been sent out to  investigate this demonic activity and  they are traveling inside the black bull  mecca we then learned something that i  personally wasn't a big fan of and this  is an issue that i talked about in  previous videos as well it turns out  that even now 15 months after charlotte  confessed her feelings to yami there has  still been absolutely no progress  in their relationship yami wasn't even  aware that she said she loves him  because he was passed out and i guess no  one thought to tell him anything  charlotte included and so charlotte just  went back to being super shy and awkward  around him although it's even worse now  because even the normally clueless yami  finally realizes that she's acting  pretty weird and that is when finral  finally decides to tell yami that  charlotte loves him and that she  confessed to him back in the spade  kingdom and yeah i guess no one thought  to say anything about this to yami for  15 freaking months until finral just  casually dropped it now yami then  decides to take a potty break so that he  can sit down on the toilet and process  this information i guess we now know why  we see yami on the toilet so often the  man clearly likes to contemplate the big  questions in life while sitting on the  john  i love yami as a character but he is  just so naive and oblivious when it  comes to romance that it's crazy to  think that he's supposed to be a 30 year  old adult man he's acting all surprised  that charlotte loves him because he  thought that she hated him and it's like  man have you ever seen atsundere before  like come on yami get it together  meanwhile it seems that asta has been  dealing with similar stuff from noel and  mimosa who have apparently spent the  last 15 months feeling shy and  self-conscious around him but neither of  them has said anything to him either so  their relationships have progressed  about as much as yami's and charlotte's  yay that is super exciting and  definitely not extremely frustrating at  all then as everyone prepares to leave  the ceremony asta decides that he is  going to propose to sister lily one more  time and now that he's an adult this  will be a genuine and serious proposal  he 