een planning and of course this is just  speculation anyway those lines may have  disappeared due to a completely  different reason that is only going to  be revealed later now my question is  this  why did lucius wait 15 months before  making contact with asta what has lucius  been up to all this time when he emerged  at the end of the previous chapter i  assumed that he would now be launching  his master plan but it seems that  another 15 months passed without anyone  even realizing that something was wrong  with the wizard king how is that even  possible and why did lucius decide to  wait so long wouldn't someone have  noticed that something was so terribly  wrong with one of the most important  people in the clover kingdom in a period  of over a year  definitely let me know what you guys  think down in the comments because i am  very curious to find out what exactly  lucius is planning to do now also i  really want to know what the true nature  of the relationship between lucius and  julius is there seem to be a lot of  people out there who believe that julius  novacrono never existed and that he was  just a fake persona created by lucius to  trick everyone but that doesn't quite  add up to me julius has done some  genuinely good and selfless things  multiple times in the past and he even  risked his own life to save the capital  from poetry chibi julius also seemed to  be genuinely shocked when he realized  that he was the time devil's host and he  even tried to warn damnatio before  lucius took over on top of that we know  that the fourth zograda sibling used to  be in a wheelchair so to me this points  to the fact that there probably is a  real julius but his body has been  usurped by lucius we don't know how or  when this happened but i am excited to  discover this man's full backstory what  do you guys think is julius just a  made-up character or is he a real person  whose body was taken over by lucius and  what about the time devil asteroth where  is he in